        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/a9adbd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-23T23:14:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Greater Than Games was at GrandCon this past weekend and it was a great event! Over 1400 people bought badges. I ran 5 full games of Sentinels over the the weekend in the gaming hall with a total of 23 players. Most of them knew nothing about the game and really enjoyed it! It was nice meeting Christopher and getting a chance to talk with him about the game and it was cool he made sure that everyone who played in my games got one of the Alternate character cards for trying it out! Running Sentinels was by far the highlight of my weekend!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:17.899Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
